  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "My understanding is that the RELS-EXT datastream contains RDF data.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The MIME type for RDF is application/rdf+xml as specified on ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/TR/rdf-syntax-grammar/#section-MIME-Type"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/TR/rdf-syntax-grammar/#section-MIME-Type",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "So why does Fedora create RELS-EXT datastreams with the text/xml MIME type ?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I suggest using the application/rdf+xml MIME type for RELS-EXT datastreams. It would better describe the content.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Any comment appreciated ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "id": "1f642",
        "shortName": ":slight_smile:",
        "text": "🙂"
       },
       "type": "emoji"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keep up the good work,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nicolas Raoul.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
